* OHMNI BEH-CAP-FILM subcircuit (metallised film, incl. X2), behavioural_approximation
* ports: p n flag. flag bitmask: 1 = |V| > VRPK (peak rating; for AC-rated parts VRPK = sqrt(2)*Vrms)
* ESR is a constant chosen from tan(delta) at a reference frequency: ESR = TAND/(2*pi*FREF*C0) (real tan(delta) rises with f, see doc)
.subckt ohm_film p n flag params: C0=1u TAND=20e-4 FREF=1k ESL=15n RLK=15g VRPK=388.9
.param ESRV={TAND/(2*3.14159265358979*FREF*C0)}
Lesl p a {ESL}
Resr a b {ESRV}
Cb b n {C0}
Rlk b n {RLK}
Bflag flag 0 V = 'abs(v(b,n)) > {VRPK} ? 1 : 0'
.ends
